    "AnnotationPayload": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Agent-supplied context. All fields nullable per SPEC \u00a75.1.1 \u2014 agent\npopulates what it has. Proactive annotations typically populate\n``intent``/``expected_outcome``/``workflow``; reactive annotations\ntypically populate ``signal_type``/``suggested_improvement``.",
